@page "/"
@layout MainLayout

<PageTitle>Open Client | Sistema de datos comerciales de clientes</PageTitle>

<div class="landing">

    <!-- ================= HERO ================= -->
    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-copy">
            <span class="eyebrow">
                <span class="eyebrow-dot"></span>
                Open source · Licencia MIT
            </span>

            <h1 class="hero-title">
                El sistema de datos comerciales de tus
                <span class="hero-accent">clientes</span>, en tu propia infraestructura.
            </h1>

            <p class="hero-lead">
                Open Client es un servicio web con panel administrativo y consulta comercial de
                clientes. Despliega tu propio sistema de datos en minutos y conserva el control
                total sobre la información, con Blazor Web App, Docker y Azure.
            </p>

            <div class="hero-actions">
                <a href="/log-in" class="btn btn-primary">
                    Iniciar sesión
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6" />
                    </svg>
                </a>
                <a href="/docs" class="btn btn-ghost">Ver documentación</a>
            </div>

            <p class="hero-note">
                ¿Solo mirando? <a href="http://openclient.azure.app" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Abre el demo en vivo</a>.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="mock mock-panel">
                <div class="mock-panel-head">
                    <span class="mock-title">Clientes</span>
                    <span class="mock-search">Buscar cliente…</span>
                </div>
                <ul class="mock-rows">
                    <li>
                        <span class="mock-avatar mock-a1">NR</span>
                        <span class="mock-name">Nova Retail S.A.</span>
                        <span class="mock-chip mock-chip-ok">Activo</span>
                        <span class="mock-val">S/ 48.200</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="mock-avatar mock-a2">CL</span>
                        <span class="mock-name">Comercial Lima</span>
                        <span class="mock-chip mock-chip-ok">Activo</span>
                        <span class="mock-val">S/ 31.750</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="mock-avatar mock-a3">AG</span>
                        <span class="mock-name">Andes Group</span>
                        <span class="mock-chip mock-chip-mute">En pausa</span>
                        <span class="mock-val">S/ 12.900</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="mock-avatar mock-a4">VP</span>
                        <span class="mock-name">Volt Partners</span>
                        <span class="mock-chip mock-chip-ok">Activo</span>
                        <span class="mock-val">S/ 27.410</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="mock mock-mini">
                <div class="mock-mini-head">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M12 3l1.9 4.6L18.5 9l-4.6 1.9L12 15l-1.9-4.1L5.5 9l4.6-1.4L12 3Z" />
                    </svg>
                    Agente IA
                </div>
                <p>«¿Qué clientes no compran desde hace 60 días?»</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= STACK STRIP ================= -->
    <section class="stack" aria-label="Tecnologías">
        <span class="stack-label">Construido con</span>
        <ul class="stack-list">
            <li>.NET&nbsp;10</li>
            <li>Blazor Interactive Server</li>
            <li>EF&nbsp;Core&nbsp;10</li>
            <li>SQL&nbsp;Server&nbsp;2022</li>
            <li>Docker</li>
            <li>Azure Container Apps</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= FEATURES ================= -->
    <section class="section">
        <header class="section-head">
            <span class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> Qué incluye</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">Todo lo necesario para operar tu base de clientes.</h2>
            <p class="section-lead">
                Cada módulo forma parte del panel de Open Client. Nada de servicios externos:
                el sistema completo corre donde tú lo despliegues.
            </p>
        </header>

        <div class="feature-grid">
            <article class="feature-card">
                <span class="feature-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M16 19c0-2.2-1.8-4-4-4s-4 1.8-4 4M12 11a3 3 0 1 0 0-6 3 3 0 0 0 0 6Z" />
                        <path d="M20 19c0-1.6-1-3-2.5-3.6M17 10.8A3 3 0 0 0 17 5" />
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <h3>Panel de clientes</h3>
                <p>Consulta y gestión comercial de tu cartera desde una interfaz única y ordenada.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="feature-card">
                <span class="feature-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M9 8l-4 4 4 4M15 8l4 4-4 4" />
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <h3>API</h3>
                <p>Acceso programático a los datos para integrarlos con el resto de tus herramientas.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="feature-card">
                <span class="feature-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M12 3l1.9 4.6L18.5 9l-4.6 1.9L12 15l-1.9-4.1L5.5 9l4.6-1.4L12 3ZM18 15l.8 2 2 .8-2 .8-.8 2-.8-2-2-.8 2-.8.8-2Z" />
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <h3>Agente IA</h3>
                <p>Un asistente para preguntar por tu información de clientes en lenguaje natural.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="feature-card">
                <span class="feature-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true">
                        <rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="7" rx="2" />
                        <rect x="3" y="13" width="18" height="7" rx="2" />
                        <path d="M7 7.5h.01M7 16.5h.01" />
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <h3>Infraestructura propia</h3>
                <p>Imagen Docker multi-stage lista para Azure Container Apps o tu propia máquina virtual.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="feature-card">
                <span class="feature-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true">
                        <path d="M5 4h11l3 3v13H5zM9 4v6l2-1.4L13 10V4" />
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <h3>Tutoriales</h3>
                <p>Guías dentro del panel para poner en marcha cada parte del sistema.</p>
            </article>

            <article class="feature-card">
                <span class="feature-icon">
                    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true">
                        <rect x="4" y="10" width="16" height="11" rx="2" />
                        <path d="M8 10V7a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3M12 15v2" />
                    </svg>
                </span>
                <h3>Acceso protegido</h3>
                <p>Autenticación por sesión: el panel solo está disponible para usuarios con credenciales.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= PRODUCT SHOWCASE ================= -->
    <section class="section">
        <header class="section-head">
            <span class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-dot"></span> El producto</span>
            <h2 class="section-title">Un panel, una API y un despliegue reproducible.</h2>
        </header>

        <div class="showcase">
            <div class="showcase-main">
                <div class="showcase-browser">
                    <div class="browser-bar">
                        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
                        <span class="browser-url">tu-dominio.com/dashboard</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="browser-body">
                        <aside class="db-nav">
                            <span class="db-nav-item is-active">Dashboard</span>
                            <span class="db-nav-item">Clientes</span>
                            <span class="db-nav-item">API</span>
                            <span class="db-nav-item">Agente IA</span>
                            <span class="db-nav-item">Tutoriales</span>
                            <span class="db-nav-item">Configuración</span>
                        </aside>
                        <div class="db-content">
                            <div class="db-stat-row">
                                <div class="db-stat">
                                    <span class="db-stat-label">Clientes</span>
                                    <span class="db-stat-value">1.284</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="db-stat">
                                    <span class="db-stat-label">Activos</span>
                                    <span class="db-stat-value">947</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="db-stat">
                                    <span class="db-stat-label">Consultas hoy</span>
                                    <span class="db-stat-value">312</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div class="db-chart">
                                <span style="height:38%"></span>
                                <span style="height:56%"></span>
                                <span style="height:44%"></span>
                                <span style="height:71%"></span>
                                <span style="height:63%"></span>
                                <span style="height:88%"></span>
                                <span style="height:74%"></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="showcase-side">
                <div class="code-card">
                    <div class="code-card-head">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true">
                            <path d="M4 5h16v14H4zM7 9l3 3-3 3M13 15h4" />
                        </svg>
                        Instalación local
                    </div>
                    <pre class="code-block"><span class="code-prompt">$</span> curl -sSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArcGabicho/open-client/master/scripts/setup.sh | bash</pre>
                </div>

                <div class="code-card">
                    <div class="code-card-head">
                        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" aria-hidden="true">
                            <path d="M12 3l8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5v-9zM4 7.5l8 4.5 8-4.5M12 21v-9" />
                        </svg>
                        Despliegue
                    </div>
                    <pre class="code-block"><span class="code-prompt">$</span> curl -sSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ArcGabicho/open-client/master/scripts/deploy.sh | bash</pre>
                    <p class="code-foot">Compatible con Azure Container Apps y Azure VM.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= FINAL CTA ================= -->
    <section class="cta-panel">
        <div class="cta-panel-copy">
            <h2>Despliega Open Client en tu propia infraestructura.</h2>
            <p>Clona el repositorio, ejecuta un script y ten tu panel comercial funcionando.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="cta-panel-actions">
            <a href="/log-in" class="btn btn-primary">Iniciar sesión</a>
            <a href="https://github.com/ArcGabicho/open-client" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-ghost">
                Ver en GitHub
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

</div>
